    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The oversized “One residual evidence gap.” headline, restrained cyan/red/amber accents, and forensic monospace labeling create a coherent defense-lab identity across all viewports. However, the core composition remains a familiar dark dashboard of bordered cards, status pills, and three-column facts; the “unknown” is described rather than expressed through a distinctive visual device. The header reinforces the brand but is conventional navigation.",
